        <h2>Who Should Choose ZYN?</h2>

        <ul>
          <li><strong>Budget-conscious users:</strong> Entry-level ZYN cans start at €1.22 and work perfectly for most users.</li>
          <li><strong>Flavour explorers:</strong> With 51 products, you can try 20+ different combinations and still have new flavours to discover.</li>
          <li><strong>Discretion matters:</strong> ZYN Mini is nearly invisible, and the dry pouch format won't stain your teeth or mouth.</li>
          <li><strong>Beginners:</strong> ZYN S1 (1.5mg) is the gentlest entry point.</li>
          <li><strong>Professionals:</strong> Long-lasting, dry, and odourless. ZYN doesn't interfere with your image or meetings.</li>
          <li><strong>Stability matters:</strong> PMI-backed pharmaceutical consistency.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Who Should Choose LOOP?</h2>

        <ul>
          <li><strong>Flavour adventurers:</strong> Habanero Mint, Red Chili Melon, Jalapeño Lime—LOOP doesn't play it safe.</li>
          <li><strong>Speed seekers:</strong> Instant Rush technology gives you nicotine in 3–5 minutes.</li>
          <li><strong>Quitters:</strong> LOOP's nicotine-free option is genuinely useful for breaking the habit while keeping the ritual.</li>
          <li><strong>Environmentalists:</strong> Plant-based cans matter if you care about sustainability.</li>
          <li><strong>Enthusiasts:</strong> If premium formulation and technology justify the cost, LOOP is worth it.</li>
          <li><strong>Moist pouch fans:</strong> LOOP's moisture content delivers faster flavour bloom.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>The Final Verdict</h2>

        <p>In 2026, <strong>ZYN is the better choice for most people.</strong> It offers unbeatable versatility (51 products), aggressive pricing (starting at €1.22), and pharmaceutical reliability. If you're new to nicotine pouches or want to explore without commitment, ZYN is the logical starting point.</p>

        <p><strong>LOOP is the better choice if you've already decided what you want and are willing to pay for it.</strong> The Instant Rush technology is genuinely faster, the flavours are genuinely bolder, and the plant-based cans are genuinely better for the planet.</p>

        <p>The good news: both brands are excellent, and both are available across Europe. Start with <a href="/brands/zyn">ZYN</a> if unsure. Switch to <a href="/brands/loop">LOOP</a> if you want to upgrade the experience.</p>

        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Is ZYN stronger than LOOP?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">No. Both reach 15–16.5mg nicotine. The difference is <em>speed:</em> LOOP delivers its nicotine faster via Instant Rush technology, so even a LOOP "Normal" (3–4mg) might feel like a stronger hit because it arrives quickly.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Which has more flavours?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2"><strong>ZYN</strong> has more flavours (15+) across 51 products. <strong>LOOP</strong> has fewer flavours (10+) across 32 products, but they're more adventurous.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Which is cheaper?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2"><strong>ZYN</strong> is significantly cheaper. Entry-level ZYN starts at €1.22 per can; LOOP's minimum is €4.17.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Can I use both ZYN and LOOP?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">Absolutely. Many users rotate between brands for variety or reserve LOOP for special occasions.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Which is better for beginners?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2"><strong>ZYN S1 (1.5mg)</strong> is the gentlest introduction to nicotine pouches.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Does LOOP really release nicotine faster?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">Yes. Clinical studies confirm Instant Rush technology delivers nicotine in 3–5 minutes, compared to 5–8 minutes for traditional pouches like ZYN.</p>
        </details>

        <h2>Related Reading</h2>

        <p>Want to go deeper? Check out our <a href="/blog/zyn-flavours-complete-guide">complete ZYN flavours guide</a>, our <a href="/blog/loop-nicotine-pouches-complete-guide">LOOP review and flavour breakdown</a>, or our <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-your-strength">guide to choosing your nicotine strength</a>. New to pouches? Start with our <a href="/beginners">beginner's guide to nicotine pouches.</a></p>

